    <Description>There is not much macro for gamers at 1.0 800DPI sensitivity, here is a no recoil macro for UMP45.

The macro is not perfect but it's really better than nothing and I hope to help those who play with this sensitivity.

SENSE: 1.0
DPI: 800
1920x1080

If you have any feedback, don't hesitate.

I will post other macros for those who play with my sensitivity, trying each time to make a good macro. 

Have fun and GO RUSH B NO STOP !</Description>
